{"seq":1,"slug":"node-system","title":"DaVinci Resolve 节点系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/node-system","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"davinci-resolve-节点系统\">DaVinci Resolve 节点系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>节点系统是 DaVinci Resolve 调色引擎的架构基础，其核心要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有向无环图</strong>：调色流程被抽象为 DAG，每个节点是一个独立处理步骤，连线定义信号流向，可分支、可合并。</li>\n<li><strong>节点 vs 图层</strong>：节点系统支持任意路由与选区复用，图层系统则严格线性堆叠，二者在灵活性与学习曲线上各有取舍。</li>\n<li><strong>四类基础节点</strong>：串行节点按顺序处理，并行节点混合多分支，图层节点按 Alpha 合成，外部节点自动处理选区之外。</li>\n<li><strong>Key 与 RGB 分离</strong>：每节点有 RGB 与 Key 两对输入/输出，选区可独立传递并被多个调整节点复用。</li>\n<li><strong>Splitter/Combiner</strong>：把 RGB 分解为 RGB/HSL/YUV/Lab 等通道独立处理后合并，支持单通道精细操作。</li>\n<li><strong>可维护性靠规范</strong>：节点命名与模板化把管理复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到线性，是大型项目的必要纪律。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"节点架构设计理念\">节点架构设计理念</h2><p>DaVinci Resolve 的节点系统（Node-Based System）是其调色引擎的核心架构，也是区别于其他 NLE 内置调色工具（如 Premiere Pro 的 Lumetri）的根本特征。节点系统将调色流程抽象为有向无环图（DAG），每个节点代表一个独立的处理步骤，节点之间通过连线定义信号流向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;节点类型&quot;&#10;        SERIAL[&quot;串行节点\\n(Serial Node)&quot;]&#10;        PARALLEL[&quot;并行节点\\n(Parallel Node)&quot;]&#10;        LAYER[&quot;图层节点\\n(Layer Node)&quot;]&#10;        SPLITTER[&quot;分离器\\n(Splitter/Combiner)&quot;]&#10;        OUTSIDE[&quot;外部节点\\n(Outside Node)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;信号流&quot;&#10;        INPUT[输入信号] --&gt; S1[Node 1]&#10;        S1 --&gt; S2[Node 2]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[Node 3]&#10;        S3 --&gt; OUTPUT[输出信号]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"节点类型\"\n        SERIAL[\"串行节点\\n(Serial Node)\"]\n        PARALLEL[\"并行节点\\n(Parallel Node)\"]\n        LAYER[\"图层节点\\n(Layer Node)\"]\n        SPLITTER[\"分离器\\n(Splitter/Combiner)\"]\n        OUTSIDE[\"外部节点\\n(Outside Node)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"信号流\"\n        INPUT[输入信号] --&gt; S1[Node 1]\n        S1 --&gt; S2[Node 2]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[Node 3]\n        S3 --&gt; OUTPUT[输出信号]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"节点-vs-图层的哲学差异\">节点 vs 图层的哲学差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>节点系统（DaVinci Resolve）</th>\n<th>图层系统（Premiere/FCPX）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>处理模型</td>\n<td>有向图（DAG）</td>\n<td>线性堆栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>可分支/合并/并行</td>\n<td>严格从下到上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>无重复像素遍历</td>\n<td>每层重新遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>流程图（清晰直观）</td>\n<td>列表（需展开查看）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选区共享</td>\n<td>Key Output 独立传递</td>\n<td>每层独立选区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>较陡</td>\n<td>较平</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节点系统优势</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>无损处理</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>任意路由</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>选区复用</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>效率最优化</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节点系统优势} = \\text{无损处理} + \\text{任意路由} + \\text{选区复用} + \\text{效率最优化}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节点系统优势</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无损处理</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">任意路由</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选区复用</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">效率最优化</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"核心节点类型\">核心节点类型</h2><h3 id=\"串行节点-serial-node\">串行节点（Serial Node）</h3><p>串行节点是最基础的节点类型——上一个节点的输出作为下一个节点的输入，形成线性链条：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顺序</th>\n<th>推荐用途</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node 1</td>\n<td>一次校正（曝光/白平衡）</td>\n<td>建立中性基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node 2</td>\n<td>色彩平衡</td>\n<td>精细调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node 3</td>\n<td>创意 Look / LUT</td>\n<td>风格化处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node 4</td>\n<td>二次校正（肤色/天空）</td>\n<td>局部精细化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node 5</td>\n<td>暗角/效果</td>\n<td>最终修饰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node 6</td>\n<td>输出限制 (Broadcast Safe)</td>\n<td>合规保障</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    N1[&quot;Node 1\\n一次校正&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;Node 2\\n色彩平衡&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt; N3[&quot;Node 3\\nCreative LUT&quot;]&#10;    N3 --&gt; N4[&quot;Node 4\\n肤色保护&quot;]&#10;    N4 --&gt; N5[&quot;Node 5\\n暗角&quot;]&#10;    N5 --&gt; N6[&quot;Node 6\\nBroadcast Safe&quot;]\">graph LR\n    N1[\"Node 1\\n一次校正\"] --&gt; N2[\"Node 2\\n色彩平衡\"]\n    N2 --&gt; N3[\"Node 3\\nCreative LUT\"]\n    N3 --&gt; N4[\"Node 4\\n肤色保护\"]\n    N4 --&gt; N5[\"Node 5\\n暗角\"]\n    N5 --&gt; N6[\"Node 6\\nBroadcast Safe\"]</pre><h3 id=\"并行节点-parallel-node\">并行节点（Parallel Node）</h3><p>并行节点同时处理同一输入信号的多个分支，然后将结果混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Parallel Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>Node</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Parallel Output} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\text{Node}_i(\\text{Input})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Parallel Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Node</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同时对高光和暗部做不同方向的色彩偏移</li>\n<li>多个 Qualifier 选区同时处理</li>\n<li>实验性对比不同 Look</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"图层节点-layer-node\">图层节点（Layer Node）</h3><p>图层节点类似于 Photoshop 的图层概念——后添加的节点在&quot;上层&quot;，通过 Alpha 通道或混合模式与底层合成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>混合模式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>常见用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Normal</td>\n<td>Alpha 合成</td>\n<td>选区叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add</td>\n<td>加法混合</td>\n<td>光效叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply</td>\n<td>乘法混合</td>\n<td>暗化/阴影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Soft Light</td>\n<td>柔光</td>\n<td>微妙调色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overlay</td>\n<td>叠加</td>\n<td>对比度增强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"外部节点-outside-node\">外部节点（Outside Node）</h3><p>当一个节点包含 Qualifier 或 Power Window 选区时，Outside Node 自动获得该选区的反转——处理选区之外的所有区域。这避免了手动创建反向遮罩。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Outside Mask</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Inside Mask</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Outside Mask} = 1 - \\text{Inside Mask}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Outside Mask</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Inside Mask</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"节点路由高级技巧\">节点路由高级技巧</h2><h3 id=\"key-输出与-alpha-传递\">Key 输出与 Alpha 传递</h3><p>每个节点有两对输入/输出：RGB 信号（绿色三角）和 Key/Alpha 信号（蓝色三角）。Key 输出允许将一个节点的选区传递给后续节点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Key 传递示例&quot;&#10;        QUAL[&quot;Node A\\nQualifier 肤色选区&quot;]&#10;        FIX[&quot;Node B\\n肤色修正&quot;]&#10;&#10;        QUAL --&gt;|&quot;RGB&quot;| FIX&#10;        QUAL --&gt;|&quot;Key Output&quot;| FIX&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Key 传递示例\"\n        QUAL[\"Node A\\nQualifier 肤色选区\"]\n        FIX[\"Node B\\n肤色修正\"]\n\n        QUAL --&gt;|\"RGB\"| FIX\n        QUAL --&gt;|\"Key Output\"| FIX\n    end</pre><p>这种分离设计的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选区创建和色彩调整分离为独立节点</li>\n<li>一个选区可被多个调整节点复用</li>\n<li>选区可被模糊/腐蚀/膨胀后再传递</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"splitter-combiner-分离-合并器\">Splitter/Combiner（分离/合并器）</h3><p>Splitter 将 RGB 信号分解为独立通道，允许对单通道独立处理后再合并：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分离模式</th>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>R / G / B</td>\n<td>单通道降噪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HSL</td>\n<td>H / S / L</td>\n<td>仅处理亮度通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YUV</td>\n<td>Y / U / V</td>\n<td>亮度/色度分离处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lab</td>\n<td>L / a / b</td>\n<td>感知均匀空间处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节点编辑器工作流实践\">节点编辑器工作流实践</h2><h3 id=\"标准节点模板\">标准节点模板</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目类型</th>\n<th>推荐节点数</th>\n<th>模板结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快速调色</td>\n<td>3-4</td>\n<td>校正 → Look → 暗角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准叙事</td>\n<td>5-7</td>\n<td>校正 → 平衡 → Look → 二次校正 → 效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂电影</td>\n<td>8-12</td>\n<td>多层二次校正 + 并行 + 图层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告/MV</td>\n<td>6-10</td>\n<td>Look Dev → 选区 × N → 效果 × N</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"节点命名规范\">节点命名规范</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命名模式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功能命名</td>\n<td>&quot;WB Fix&quot;, &quot;Skin&quot;, &quot;Sky&quot;</td>\n<td>清晰直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编号+功能</td>\n<td>&quot;01_Primary&quot;, &quot;02_Look&quot;</td>\n<td>有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色标记</td>\n<td>红=校正，绿=创意，蓝=效果</td>\n<td>视觉快速识别</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节点管理复杂度</mtext><mo>∝</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>无命名时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节点管理复杂度} \\propto N_{nodes}^2 \\quad (\\text{无命名时})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节点管理复杂度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无命名时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>命名后复杂度降为线性，大型项目中必须严格执行命名规范。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减少冗余节点</td>\n<td>加速渲染</td>\n<td>合并功能相近的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关闭未使用节点</td>\n<td>跳过计算</td>\n<td>Node → Disable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Shared Node</td>\n<td>多片段共享</td>\n<td>右键 → Add Shared Node</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理模式</td>\n<td>实时预览</td>\n<td>Timeline → Proxy Mode</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 加速</td>\n<td>全节点 GPU 处理</td>\n<td>Preferences → GPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>截至 2026 年，DaVinci Resolve 19 的节点系统支持最多 99 个串行节点、无限并行/图层分支，并通过 GPU 并行计算实现复杂节点链的实时处理（4K@24fps 约需 RTX 4060 以上）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>节点系统把调色流程建模为有向无环图，每个节点承载一个独立处理步骤，通过连线实现任意路由、分支与合并，这是它区别于图层式 NLE 调色工具的根本所在。串行、并行、图层、外部四类节点覆盖了从线性处理到选区反选的常见需求，而 Key 与 RGB 双通道分离的设计让选区可以被多个调整节点复用。Splitter/Combiner 进一步把通道分解能力引入节点链。实践中，标准节点模板与命名规范是控制复杂度的关键——不加管理时节点数增长会带来平方级的维护成本。GPU 加速与共享节点则保证了复杂节点链的实时性能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DaVinci Resolve 节点系统","id":"davinci-resolve-节点系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"节点架构设计理念","id":"节点架构设计理念"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 vs 图层的哲学差异","id":"节点-vs-图层的哲学差异"},{"level":2,"text":"核心节点类型","id":"核心节点类型"},{"level":3,"text":"串行节点（Serial Node）","id":"串行节点-serial-node"},{"level":3,"text":"并行节点（Parallel Node）","id":"并行节点-parallel-node"},{"level":3,"text":"图层节点（Layer Node）","id":"图层节点-layer-node"},{"level":3,"text":"外部节点（Outside Node）","id":"外部节点-outside-node"},{"level":2,"text":"节点路由高级技巧","id":"节点路由高级技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"Key 输出与 Alpha 传递","id":"key-输出与-alpha-传递"},{"level":3,"text":"Splitter/Combiner（分离/合并器）","id":"splitter-combiner-分离-合并器"},{"level":2,"text":"节点编辑器工作流实践","id":"节点编辑器工作流实践"},{"level":3,"text":"标准节点模板","id":"标准节点模板"},{"level":3,"text":"节点命名规范","id":"节点命名规范"},{"level":3,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"风格化处理与视觉叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/visual-narrative"},"next":{"title":"分屏对比与参考工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/split-screen-reference"}}